320	    /**
321	     * Whether this owner, when created, softly matched an already-stored owner: one that
322	     * shares its last name and postcode but carries a different telephone. Assigned on
323	     * create; when {@code true}, {@link #getPossibleDuplicateOf()} identifies the matched
